{"posts":[{"id":"hs_p43_1051","t":"I feel like I've taken a step forward in my understanding of the market in the past day or two...thanks to everyone here for helping me!","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1051","p":43,"im":[],"m":1051},{"id":"hs_p43_1052","t":"EUR-USD - Another example:\n\nLet's take a closer look at what happens on the LTF:\n\nHTF First (15M Chart)\n\nOn the 1-minute chart it is easy to see how price is reacting to a LTF true supply zone. Price returns to the MPL of this zone to consume FOF. Price proceeds to compress all the way down to the last set of orders...which is exactly where price reacted on its FTB.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1052","p":43,"im":["bf720ac58a52a0178fc37b1534be140b99b3a591","90da589b3299af1b92f3a7037bc235ec197d6e60"],"m":1052},{"id":"hs_p43_1053","t":"EUR-JPY:\n\n15M Chart:\n\nClose up - always investigate why levels react where they do...","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1053","p":43,"im":["1f618b125bc84e812585edea611ef0c2dae9cfd2","1ded227b06b0c3d35f8a809bbce551143147a940"],"m":1053},{"id":"hs_p43_1054","t":"EUR-JPY - New example...this time one that failed.\n\nHere is the 15M chart:\n\nHere is the LTF 1-min chart:\n\nI would have went short at FL Box A, since FL Box B reacted off of it. I would have chose a higher level (earlier EG) but I saw no areas with FOF...it was all spiked. The solid red lines shows where price reacted.\n\nNot every setup works, which is why I must remember to always control risk and only choose the highest R:R opportunities.\n\nOne last look at the area where price bounced....good area, but I wouldn't have traded it because I saw OF was already spiked/consumed. Obviously there was enough still left over...","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1054","p":43,"im":["1f618b125bc84e812585edea611ef0c2dae9cfd2","6c197a7505662364dcc003abad3e5a0492132178","b62659f5f1aa93ca209f4b7919f268cc5ffc56a7","5d2923b0eb2ce27b6354b2cd1c5740c01fd8fe74"],"m":1054},{"id":"hs_p43_1055","t":"Anyone watching this? GBP-CHF\n\nI see two areas where price might bounce....I like the blue rectangle at #1.\n\nHTF shows price EG in to CP zone. Target for longs just above the CP zone.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1055","p":43,"im":["cd55b6e282c844c4a0c171c238c353fc327e9aad","c6ac225838b18aa524eda12bce40790c42566cf8","69d4ae060e8ebf36941f7cceca6af415ca72c747"],"m":1055},{"id":"hs_p43_1056","t":"USD CAD:\n\nPractice - Price bounces at LTF QM level","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1056","p":43,"im":["cbddfa77b22f33ce1f00a79c0345072fe3dec54e","4fe739d56bd162f98ae2fe0a08c3d7be9f12602f"],"m":1056},{"id":"hs_p43_1057","t":"More examples: USD -CAD\n\nThis zone was a great area to get long....1-min chart provided the perfect entry. All LTF swap zones drawn, and price bounced as expected.\n\nStart with a higher time frame chart to find a good swap zone, then check LTF to ID all smaller swap zones to refine entry. Refined entry = small stop = high R:R\n\nEntry point shown on chart below..amazing how well price bounced at this level!","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1057","p":43,"im":["3a5250db076a8c01f22c2cb8d5e29c4d31591038","1342a139893928805e6be64858290f4ea836e9d6","43cbf47ecff2c14c318cedcb84ce7a0fb68d1825"],"m":1057},{"id":"hs_p43_1058","t":"This is getting fun\n\nAnother perfect example USD-CAD:\n\nHigher time frame:\n\nLTF- look for lower time frame swap zones. In this scenario there are two swap zones that look like they could both work. Please refer to the chart below. Within FL Box D you can see FL Box A & B - both are good swap zones.\n\nLook at the red circle...you will see there is a tiny swap zone there...it is also an important DP. Price will bounce at or near to this level.\n\nAnd the trade result...perfect reaction.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1058","p":43,"im":["aebd70cff56a42ebf518a09fdcc46c26e12f508f","363dd992c11719aa77bf0ac704d0f63e8ecdae7b","a26cc853b561183dff9043ff0e860bfb74942612","6d78c1888bc82bd90ac3ae7e5b7de7e64f225d90"],"m":1058},{"id":"hs_p43_1059","t":"USD-CAD Fakeout...always be suspicious of a QM setting up just under/above a significant FL.\n\nEasier to see on LTF","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1059","p":43,"im":["d14fbdde0b318c85cd7f72e6a85ad561a606484c","570a0af19f1b1dfcd16f121fc6c8699b21999649"],"m":1059},{"id":"hs_p43_1060","t":"USD-CHF - Practice","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1060","p":43,"im":["a11bf8b3b2b9fa48b55e923170d8948f50ac7e8d","babeda26f2d913e41da7e2dd1e43b744f80675ed"],"m":1060},{"id":"hs_p43_1061","t":"Going back to Salivan's trade: #658 in his journal\n\nUSD-JPY:\n\nwww.readthemarket.com/index.php/en/forum...art-of-war?start=650\n\nSomething that interested me about this trade was his target was also an entry....\n\n15M time Frame:\n\nDetailed LTF: look at the target and entry...I see two areas that might work. Salivan chose # 2, which was the first engulf of a LTF swap zone.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1061","p":43,"im":["b5d852d5782bed8eb45af3fb7dcfaaaa40da501e","36d16d7bc3adeca7f493b3b6a45f65ae25a6a90d","02ebc0a8fc5a4bf13f4f485b4d1160429bd6ac12"],"m":1061},{"id":"hs_p43_1062","t":"USD-JPY - tough FO on this...this FO broke the low of FL Box 1, which is the lowest level I can see as a possible origin/true demand. FL Box 2 looks like a reaction to FL Box 1.\n\nAny ideas on a way to avoid something like this? The engulf was valid, and price hit its target, but the nasty fakeout would have stopped me out.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1062","p":43,"im":["a1df43a92b786b6c22c48fb1cc92e5ec2b9349ca"],"m":1062},{"id":"hs_p43_1063","t":"Another look at Salivan's AUD-USD trade:\n\nLTF - swap zones are shown below. Price bounces off of the first swap zone that formed in the FL Box.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1063","p":43,"im":["2a8c825f002dedadd4a5bf872f50a8418726a12f","39fb78b830b67a86dc2c0bf60379595802157b49"],"m":1063},{"id":"hs_p43_1064","t":"AUD-USD\n\nHourly (HTF) Chart:\n\n1-minute chart shows the swap zone that formed. Price bounced right at this zone.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1064","p":43,"im":["b7a4c696dd9a25a543356cd47d6449bae46e0f71","565ec6c36b9b07a81be7dd9b1899fc1350f60936","ca4cfc12d1e4268c1ac6c301332fe9672f0b0d08"],"m":1064},{"id":"hs_p43_1065","t":"AUD-USD\n\nHTF shows price FO to MPL...but no EG to the upside.\n\nThis is a good location to look for a TT when price RT.\n\nHTF:\n\nLTF Swap Zones shown: Fl Box D could also be a good place to short, but when in doubt, choose the most recent swap zone with FOF still existing. In this case, Fl Box C ended up being the location where price bounced.\n\nThere is an especially strong bounce, with a substantial downside follow-through (over 400 pip drop proceeding the reaction to this FL). This is somewhat predictable considering price FO to a HTF MPL without engulfing to the upside.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1065","p":43,"im":["25c2ab8ac91ad8314e2d7203bb028563c80bb080","dbb3ba830741efa7e2f6ad41b672c4d4af320b44"],"m":1065},{"id":"hs_p43_1066","t":"USD-CHF - there was a HTF opportunity to short this (as you can see on the Daily chart below) but I am focusing on the LTF opportunity to buy.\n\nDaily chart shows price bounce at an important HTF supply zone, but there was no EG to the upside. Because of this, I want to be cautious taking any longs, as price may RT quite far. Still, there is a good place with FOF where a scalp is possible.\n\nThe hourly chart zooms in on the location:\n\nLTF shows the swap zones and entry.\n\nQuick scalp, conservative target.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1066","p":43,"im":["27139f302ed46bd3e65bceea69874c85c36eb072","c9890b1db09a8758726d3010939ae006da1f98ea","68e78e85cc196a7216c7d261c55c4ab2843e6402","2e01f6be252b5e93106104177580751d54f6ffaa"],"m":1066},{"id":"hs_p43_1067","t":"hoeschec wrote: EUR-USD - Another example:\n\nLet's take a closer look at what happens on the LTF:\n\nHTF First (15M Chart)\n\nHi H,\n\nIf I may, I would like to clarify the importance of the level that you are dissecting. Hopefully, all readers can benefit from what you share.\n\nFrom Daily level, we can see how 1.071 level is being approached by Hoeschec's chart.\n\nNow that black box is Hoeschec's dissected area. which is very important considering what happened after that box is in action.","a":"staurum","d":"","n":"#1067","p":43,"im":["bf720ac58a52a0178fc37b1534be140b99b3a591","90da589b3299af1b92f3a7037bc235ec197d6e60","c542e1dc2779fb4a86d2698a17dbff943f232011","3c714193fcb0efd4daaf3dc781725ad911b01810"],"m":1067},{"id":"hs_p43_1068","t":"hoeschec wrote: EUR-JPY - New example...this time one that failed.\n\nHere is the 15M chart:\n\nHi H, I now understand why you pick this dissection journal and post it here. Any reader should benefit from this. I am again merely showing why what you share here re EURJPY is so important.\n\nDaily: We have an engulf.\n\nM15: Hoeschec helps us identifying the Decision Point for that engulf.","a":"staurum","d":"","n":"#1068","p":43,"im":["1f618b125bc84e812585edea611ef0c2dae9cfd2","6c197a7505662364dcc003abad3e5a0492132178","b62659f5f1aa93ca209f4b7919f268cc5ffc56a7","5d2923b0eb2ce27b6354b2cd1c5740c01fd8fe74","76e18e9b84123f8bdf00526fc57ca01d42ecfc03","170cf07e7ff086d05a1b296d975c7d6d36d134fd"],"m":1068},{"id":"hs_p43_1069","t":"hoeschec wrote: USD CAD:\n\nPractice - Price bounces at LTF QM level\n\nHi H, i am sorry to again put this chart. I just can't help myself trying to show my understanding why you pick your charts. I just felt like you are trying to hide this importance so that a reader like me (also a learner) become curious and find out more.\n\nthanks to you.","a":"staurum","d":"","n":"#1069","p":43,"im":["cbddfa77b22f33ce1f00a79c0345072fe3dec54e","4fe739d56bd162f98ae2fe0a08c3d7be9f12602f","23a8ddad43f1960fabd19cd56fc9afa0b5e0808a"],"m":1069},{"id":"hs_p43_1070","t":"staurum wrote:\n\nhoeschec wrote: USD CAD:\n\nPractice - Price bounces at LTF QM level\n\nGreat posts, staurum!\n\nYou labeled some areas I missed. You have a great read on price","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1070","p":43,"im":["cbddfa77b22f33ce1f00a79c0345072fe3dec54e","4fe739d56bd162f98ae2fe0a08c3d7be9f12602f","23a8ddad43f1960fabd19cd56fc9afa0b5e0808a"],"m":1070},{"id":"hs_p43_1071","t":"Just set entry order on EUR/JPY (demo only)\n\nI found a HTF QM level that occurs at an area with lots of history. Here is a top down analysis:\n\nHTF: The 4-hour chart will focus on the red circle.\n\n4-HR\n\n1-HR\n\nLTF\n\nClose up of entry & Stop. I will probably adjust the limit @ my target.","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1071","p":43,"im":["44a3bcc91d4fe0a0edc32a49326484bc56866dd1","4b8ddcab32a10f86f5c0f5e1edf7ce22335e4847","ad2038f4efd6074fae0e538e9d0191136f60e4ca","c79e3a7c63dffefe24c56f78129bba16fb2a64b8","ffca23497d3b67fdf94ea6d1e1d2363bc8545ddf"],"m":1071},{"id":"hs_p43_1072","t":"AUD-CAD - is anyone else watching this?","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1072","p":43,"im":["bf1a8dfb9f08784003ace4276f9f2dbe4d7a5578"],"m":1072},{"id":"hs_p43_1073","t":"Hi H, I am also digging into EURJPY and i thought since you have covered the PAST\n\nLet me add here with the Approach and possible Reaction before we could say another Thank You to RTM.\n\nMethod used: PARTY (Past, Action, Reaction, Thank You).\n\nBird'eye view\n\nLet's zoom in.\n\nAgain, many things could happen here.","a":"staurum","d":"","n":"#1073","p":43,"im":["a6ad5d8b19efced21ba76750e7cf60a380eed34e","33bb973cf1747df660817c73aec6ce2ecf102b06"],"m":1073},{"id":"hs_p43_1074","t":"Also watching EUR-GBP:\n\nHigh time frame -","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1074","p":43,"im":["db7a437606b8a7f788067a15d50448eab3eee67b","0600ec80150cde61c28bf004af957ad10df7b5f1","6321e36ebdd8c6d844f91f88f0d86592f039f2c3"],"m":1074},{"id":"hs_p43_1075","t":"EUR-GBP - I'm short\n\nLet's see if we get some follow-through...\n\nHTF","a":"hoeschec","d":"","n":"#1075","p":43,"im":["7f17d62f348f2101efc8ccbbbf9f4b08b04eb4fc","dc60b4cde847f26d77b7a6cfb8ef68e40c208b86"],"m":1075}],"images":[{"k":"bf720ac58a52a0178fc37b1534be140b99b3a591","t":"assets/thumbs/bf720ac58a52a0178fc37b1534be140b99b3a591.webp","f":"assets/images/bf720ac58a52a0178fc37b1534be140b99b3a591.png","w":1800,"h":943,"b":227980,"o":"bf720ac58a52a0178fc37b1534be140b99b3a591.png","p":43,"pid":"hs_p43_1067"},{"k":"90da589b3299af1b92f3a7037bc235ec197d6e60","t":"assets/thumbs/90da589b3299af1b92f3a7037bc235ec197d6e60.webp","f":"assets/images/90da589b3299af1b92f3a7037bc235ec197d6e60.png","w":1800,"h":941,"b":478166,"o":"90da589b3299af1b92f3a7037bc235ec197d6e60.png","p":43,"pid":"hs_p43_1067"},{"k":"1f618b125bc84e812585edea611ef0c2dae9cfd2","t":"assets/thumbs/1f618b125bc84e812585edea611ef0c2dae9cfd2.webp","f":"assets/images/1f618b125bc84e812585edea611ef0c2dae9cfd2.png","w":1800,"h":935,"b":371699,"o":"1f618b125bc84e812585edea611ef0c2dae9cfd2.png","p":43,"pid":"hs_p43_1068"},{"k":"1ded227b06b0c3d35f8a809bbce551143147a940","t":"assets/thumbs/1ded227b06b0c3d35f8a809bbce551143147a940.webp","f":"assets/images/1ded227b06b0c3d35f8a809bbce551143147a940.png","w":1800,"h":937,"b":433845,"o":"1ded227b06b0c3d35f8a809bbce551143147a940.png","p":43,"pid":"hs_p43_1053"},{"k":"6c197a7505662364dcc003abad3e5a0492132178","t":"assets/thumbs/6c197a7505662364dcc003abad3e5a0492132178.webp","f":"assets/images/6c197a7505662364dcc003abad3e5a0492132178.png","w":1800,"h":935,"b":392082,"o":"6c197a7505662364dcc003abad3e5a0492132178.png","p":43,"pid":"hs_p43_1068"},{"k":"b62659f5f1aa93ca209f4b7919f268cc5ffc56a7","t":"assets/thumbs/b62659f5f1aa93ca209f4b7919f268cc5ffc56a7.webp","f":"assets/images/b62659f5f1aa93ca209f4b7919f268cc5ffc56a7.png","w":1800,"h":927,"b":535398,"o":"b62659f5f1aa93ca209f4b7919f268cc5ffc56a7.png","p":43,"pid":"hs_p43_1068"},{"k":"5d2923b0eb2ce27b6354b2cd1c5740c01fd8fe74","t":"assets/thumbs/5d2923b0eb2ce27b6354b2cd1c5740c01fd8fe74.webp","f":"assets/images/5d2923b0eb2ce27b6354b2cd1c5740c01fd8fe74.png","w":1800,"h":921,"b":454382,"o":"5d2923b0eb2ce27b6354b2cd1c5740c01fd8fe74.png","p":43,"pid":"hs_p43_1068"},{"k":"cd55b6e282c844c4a0c171c238c353fc327e9aad","t":"assets/thumbs/cd55b6e282c844c4a0c171c238c353fc327e9aad.webp","f":"assets/images/cd55b6e282c844c4a0c171c238c353fc